          "short": "$6\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Let $b$ be the length of the other parallel side in centimetres.\n$$\\begin{align*} A&=\\frac{h(a+b)}{2}\\\\ 40&=\\frac{5(10+b)}{2}\\\\ 80&=5(10+b)\\\\ 16&=10+b\\\\ b&=16-10\\\\ b&=6\\text{ cm} \\end{align*}$$",
